em has been  helped by the government so we are  helping our government but there has to  be a good plan in place otherwise the  thousands of people that abigail my  family was standing there there was  five families i was helping two i was  able to speak and they're fine that they  left before the explosion the other  three are still missing so more families  will get hurt and die of dehydration  stamping and explosions if we did not  come up with a good strategy and plan i  think time is running out time is  running out and so many people are still  trying to figure it out thank you very  much for your time this morning we  really appreciate and glad that your  family is safe so far  if you would like to help refugees from  afghanistan we do have a list of  resources posted on our social media  channels for you to take a look at
 

